1 NAME Lars Ommundson /Tu/
2 GIVN Lars Ommundson
2 SURN Tu
2 _MARNM Tu
2 NICK Thu
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1700
2 PLAC Tu, Kleppe
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE 12 JAN 1767
