1 NAME Hallvard Olson /Grannes/
2 GIVN Hallvard Olson
2 SURN Grannes
2 _MARNM Austvoll
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1656
2 PLAC Grannes
2 ADDR
