3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norge
1 BAPM
2 DATE 14 JAN 1781
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 10 FEB 1857
2 ADDR
