2 CONT <p style="text-align: left;" dir="ltr">Ref. Gard og &AElig;tt i Sola: S&oslash;r-Kolnes, side 251, bruk 8, huslyd 13. F&oslash;dt p&aring; S&oslash;r-Kolnes i Sola, (Side 251, bruk 8, huslyd&nbsp;12,1).&nbsp;4 barn.</p> <p>Registr
