1 NAME Mons Monsson /Nor-Kolnes/
2 GIVN Mons Monsson
2 SURN Nor-Kolnes
2 _MARNM Ølberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1743
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 22 SEP 1743
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway (Dominica 15 post Trinitatis)
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 MAR 1808
