1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Time Gard og ætt IV page 300 Frøyland (2.2.1), Høyland Gards- og ættesoge page 101 Austvoll (37).
2 CONT
2 CONT To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=39895902
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen Olena Eastwold BIRTH	1834 Norway DEATH	9 May 1909 (aged 74–75) BURIAL	 Four Mile Cemetery Van Zandt County, Texas, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Wife of Enoch Eastwold'
2 CONT
2 CONT Enok Ostvold and Ellen Olena Ostvold were from Norway and changed names to Enoch Eastwold and Ellen Olena Eastwold in America. One daughters Death Cert listed mothers maiden name as Freland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ministerial log from the Lutheran Church from 4 Mile Creek indicate they had: Bertha Marie Eastwold b. 23 Jan 1854 d. Apr 2 1925 Dallas, TX married Louis Edward Fryer Omund Eastwold b.1857 married 5 Dec 1882 Betty Anderson Martin 
2 CONC Eastwold b. Nov 1861 Ellen Olena Eastwold b. 23 Nov 1865 married Reinert Reierson Enoch Eastwold b. 18 Dec 1868 d. 21 Feb 1943 El Campo, Wharton Co TX Emma Malena Eastwold b. Jan 1873 married Isaac Andrew Simmons Amanda Eastwold b
2 CONC . 4 July 1876 d. 13 Feb 1923 married 2 Apr 1899 Horace J. Jones (Oakland Cem, Terrell, Kaufman Co. TX)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha Marie Eastwold Fryer 1854–1925
2 CONT
2 CONT Omund Eastwold 1857–1932
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen Olena Eastwold Reierson 1865–1924
2 CONT
2 CONT Enoch Eastwold 1868–1943
2 CONT
2 CONT Amanda Eastwold Jones 1876–1923
