1 NAME Dorte Abrahamsdatter /Helland/
2 GIVN Dorte Abrahamsdatter
2 SURN Helland
2 _MARNM Helland
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1721
2 PLAC Helland bruk 6 Sola s136 nr 5.6
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
2 DATE 10 AUG 1721
