1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Listed in Etne-soga by Ståle Dyrvik, vol III "Folket. Gjerde sokn."  p333 Ve (2) a (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Claude.ai translation of his entry on that page
2 CONT
2 CONT "3. Bjørn Persson (6) b.1725 at Ve (2a), d.1792 at Ve. Married Lisbet Åmundsdotter b.approx.1727 at Kolbeinshaug in Ølen, d.1755 at Aksdal. Married again 1756 to Metta Olsdotter b.approx.1729 at Fatland in Fjelberg, d.1805 at Ve. 
2 CONC They lived at Aksdal 1749–1762, but then Bjørn swapped farms with his brother Jens and came back to Ve.
2 CONT Children from the first marriage (all born at Aksdal):
2 CONT
2 CONT a. Brita b.1750, d.1750 at Aksdal
2 CONT b. Åmund b.1751, d.1769 at Ve
2 CONT c. Ragnilla b.1754, d.1754 at Aksdal
2 CONT d. Ragnilla b.1755, moved approx.1779
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from the second marriage (the first three born at Aksdal):
2 CONT
2 CONT e. Per b.1757, d.1831 at Ve ndf.
2 CONT f. Mons b.1759, d.1759 at Aksdal
2 CONT g. Lisbet b.1761, d.1761 at Aksdal
2 CONT h. Lisbet b.1762, d.1846 at Fossa (3)
2 CONT i. Brita b.1765, d.1801 at Veste (5)
2 CONT j. Ola b.1768, d.1840 at Fjøsna (32)
2 CONT k. Anna b.1770, d.1828 at Osnes (4)
2 CONT l. Åmund b.1772, d.1842 at Tveito (3)
2 CONT m. Siri b.1775, d.1775
2 CONT n. Metta b.1776, d.1776"
